st cancer. The most commonly reported medications with a high association with\ngynecomastia are inhibitors of testosterone production (e.g. cyproterone acetate, spironolactone, finasteride, flutamide, ketoconazole, etc.),\nanabolic steroids, cimetidine, digoxin (digitalis), captopril, and methyldopa.\nThe following table lists medications that have been reported to be associated with gynecomastia. Most of the listed the listed drugs are\nbased on anecdotal reports and do not have high quality evidence supporting a cause-and-effect relationship. Using evidence-based criteria,\nthere is good evidence of a true association with estrogens, spironolactone, cimetidine, ketoconazole, growth hormone, gonadotropins,\nantiandrogens therapies and 5-alpha reductase inhibitors (shown in red in the table).\nMedications with fair evidence include first-generation and atypical antipsychotics in adults, calcium channel blockers, omeprazole, HIV drugs,\nalkylating agents, anabolic steroids, alcohol and opioids (shown in green in the table). Other drugs only have been reported anecdotally\nwithout quality supporting evidence.\nAntiandrogens/ inhibitors of testosterone synthesis\nDrugs of abuse","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age","drug"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"cfc07feab0114e0901dc33aa77e1951474e56ea7","duplicate_group_id":"exact-cfc07feab011","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"f9a8fdf81553c0ac025b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":143,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
