ts with adrenal insufficiency, fluid replacement does not increase the blood pressure. Corticosteroids alone will\ntreat the hypotension without any further need for fluid replacement.\n(Option D) Vasopressors such as dopamine or epinephrine are not useful for treatment of adrenal crisis because the vascular tone is already\nnormal. Vasoconstriction will not replenish the deficient volume.\n(Option E) Atropine is an anticholinergic agent that counteracts parasympathetic effects such as bradycarida. Atropine will not treat\nhypotension caused by a non-cardiovascular pathophysiology.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","drug","management","treatment"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"591bfcf5334daedf0d5ba40281d4e16ad22de032","duplicate_group_id":"exact-591bfcf5334d","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"b336719b6c576c9362f0","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":155,"source_qid":"1179"}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=exclu