In most cases, active treatment is not recommended because spontaneous resolution usually occurs upon activation of the immune response which may take from three months to three years. For individual lesions, removal by cryotherapy (option
D) or curettage may be considered but is not generally recommended as a routine treatment for the lesions.
Children with molluscum contagiosum do not require isolation or exclusion from school (option A). however, it is better to avoid sharing towels or bathing together as these may increase the risk of spread to their brothers and sisters or other
children.
(Option C) Active topical or oral antiviral therapy, such as acyclovir, is unnecessary and recommended.
Option E) Short-term use of a topical steroid for the treatment of associated eczema is recommended. There is no associated eczema in the photograph, so topical steroids are not indicated.
NOTE - Inflamed lesions do not require antibiotics either orally or topically.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2023','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"1468","duplicate_group_id":"exact-bb48e7322301","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"29e55857c50ab5616ba1","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":236,"source_qid":"1468"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
