(Options D and E) This patient may be initially placed in Trendelenburg position (head down) to relocate the pooled blood in the peripheral
venules and small veins to the heart. This results in an increase in cardiac output and blood pressure. Longer term management includes
judicious administration of crystalloids (not colloids) such as Hartman’s solution or normal saline to maintain a blood pressure of 90-100
mmHg. This is critical as hypoperfusion of the injured spine is associated with neurological sequelae and poor outcomes. These, however, do
not take precedence over oxygen supplementation as the most appropriate next step in this patient.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2023','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"989","duplicate_group_id":"exact-84f122076799","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"561060a40ae0a2d929ef","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":270,"source_qid":"989"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
